templates/settings/settings.base.json:92:        "_comment": "PLAN-152 governance-03 (mirror of dogfood ADR-106 + ADR-110): PreToolUse Pair-Rail Multi-LLM hook. When Edit|Write|MultiEdit targets an L3+ canonical-guarded path, invokes Codex MCP in read-only review mode and validates the response contains no write-shaped patches. Adopters get the codex .mcp.json from install.sh, so the rail is meaningful out of the box; on Codex unavailable it fail-OPENs with a breadcrumb (adopters without Codex pay only the no-op). Kill-switches: CEO_PAIR_RAIL_DISABLE=1, CEO_PAIR_RAIL_TIMEOUT_S (default 180s; registration cap 210s — ADR-110-AMEND-2 recalibration, invariant guarded by test_pair_rail_timeout_invariant.py).",
